    "title": "Two accused of crack cocaine possession - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Writer ,\n8 hours ago\nMARATHON — Two men were arrested Thursday, Aug. 28, after deputies said they had nearly 30 grams of crack cocaine in their possession, according to the Monroe County Sheriff's Office.\nCharles Jerome Hayes, 42, of Marathon, and Eric Devail Myles, 48, of Florida City, were both charged with trafficking in cocaine.\nDeputies reported observing the suspects take part in a drug deal. Approximately 29.56 grams of crack cocaine and $967 in cash was subsequently found during a search, reports say.\nBoth suspects were taken to jail.",
